### Pine Drink Auth API – Complete Flow
### ========================================
### @baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
### @email = testuser@example.com
### @password = Test@123456
### @siteKey = DEFAULT

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Register
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Creates a new INACTIVE account. OTP is sent to email / server log.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "siteKey": "{{siteKey}}"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Verify OTP
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Replace "otp" with the actual 6-digit code from server log or email.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2b. Resend OTP (60s cooldown)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Login
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Returns access_token and refresh_token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Get Profile (requires Bearer token)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### @accessToken = <paste access token here>
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Refresh Token
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### @refreshToken = <paste refresh token here>
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Logout
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Revokes the refresh token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}
